<title>PORTUGAL: EDP green shoe shares admitted to bourse.</title>
<headline>EDP green shoe shares admitted to bourse.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Lisbon stock exchange bulletin said 16.36 million shares from the green shoe in state utility EDP-Electricidade de Portugal were admitted to the bourse today.</p>
<p>With the exercise of the green shoe after the privatisation of a 30 percent stake in EDP on Monday, a total of 179,960,000 shares were sold.</p>
<p>EDP shares stood at 3,447 escudos, up 198, in volume of 2,224,474 shares at 1040 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
